{"t":"Grubokk","s":"grubokk-2e15b","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Grubokk</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKrailos Mines\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Mines\">Krailos Mines</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33683,31792,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33683, 31792, 6)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ogre</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Foreman</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230826102454&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grubokk_8f0f15.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Grubokk.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>&lt;belch&gt;</li><li>Tasty snacks!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Mines\">Krailos Mines</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><b>Grubokk</b> keeps an eye on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblin</a> slaves working in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Mines\">Krailos Mines</a>.\nPart of the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Grubokk.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Huh! Talking food! Hello!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Me guard goblin slaves. Good job! Free food! Hur hur!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Grrrrrr! Me mighty Grubokk! You puny morsel!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Grubokk</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Name of great warrior hero! Ate eighty-eight goblins alive in twenty-two mouthfuls while fighting eleven Thunder Tusk ogres at same time! Belched hugely when won!<br/>\nPlayer: tribe<br/>\nGrubokk: Tribes always at war with others! Bash in enemy heads! Harharr!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Thunder Tusk</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Other tribe, stupid and mean, steal from us. We fight them always!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Krailos</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Land of ogres you see out there, hu-man!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ogres</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Ogres strong! And our tribe strongest!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>goblins</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Full of air from too much fan-ci-ful words. Worship puny, powerless frog. Tinker with tools without own strength. Not know true power. Not earthed like ogres. Deserve to be slaves!<br/>\nPlayer: tools / pliers<br/>\nGrubokk: Puny goblins tinker with fiddly tools, huh. Never get anywhere with their repairs! Pah! Ogre strong, use big pliers to cut through bone and hide!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>revolt/mission</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Huh! Grubokk got all under control! Goblins quiet! But if not... tell me and Grubokk may have task for you! Harhar!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>The Great Hunger</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Yes, I always hungry! Chosen by Great Hunger! Hurhur! I made joke!<br/>\nPlayer: chief<br/>\nGrubokk: Me want to be chieftain instead of chieftain!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nGrubokk: Hur! &lt;belch&gt;<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grubokk</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"],"pos":{"x":33683,"y":31792,"z":6}}